<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian BanK reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices.</p>
<p>					Oct 23/Oct 22  Oct 23/Dec 31, 95</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.03		10.16</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.04		11.18</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.16		 4.80</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.04		-2.46</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.81		33.86</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.87		38.81</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.15	     -21.77</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.09		-5.66</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.88		46.20</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.91		52.57</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.32	     -19.43</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.10		-9.13</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
